    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d778">

                <pb facs="0867" n="581" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg581"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 300.115/6130</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Great
                        Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-11-19T21:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 19, 1915, 9 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2476. Department’s 2408, November 4. What action have you taken and with what
                    results? Cable status case. Hops urgently needed in United States.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
